{"id":"sus","lemma":"sus","pos":"det","rank":74,"glosses":["his, her, its, their (plural)","your (formal, plural)"],"ipa":"/sus/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sus.wav","examples":[{"text":"Responded a sus disparos.","en":"Return fire.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439003"},{"text":"Sus labios se encontraron.","en":"Their lips met.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735516"},{"text":"Nosotros somos sus hijos.","en":"We are his sons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442222"},{"text":"Abra bien sus ojos.","en":"Take a good look.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443082"},{"text":"Sus ojos son azules.","en":"Her eyes are blue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444130"}]}